OL,3,ABuckingham Palace works uncover trove
OL,4,Aof everyday items dating back to 1800s
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pair of battered, hobnailed boots and
OL,7,Fa newspaper cutting dating back nearly
OL,8,F140 years are among a trove of everyday
OL,9,Fobjects unearthed during restoration
OL,10,Fwork at Buckingham Palace.
OL,12,FThe misplaced items are thought to
OL,13,Fbelong to staff who worked at the
OL,14,Fpalace decades ago, and were found by
OL,15,Fworkers carrying out the #369m
OL,16,Frefurbishment.
OL,18,FA ticket for a "whist drive" - a card
OL,19,Fgame event hosted by the palace on 14
OL,20,FApril 1949 - was found embedded in a
OL,21,Flump of brick.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
