OL,3,ABuckingham Palace works uncover trove
OL,4,Aof everyday items dating back to 1800s
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral betting slips, a bottle of
OL,7,FSchweppes Still Malvern English Spring
OL,8,FWater, an empty Silk Cut cigarette
OL,9,Fcarton and a newspaper article about
OL,10,Fthe gang jailed for the 1963 Great
OL,11,FTrain Robbery were also found under
OL,12,Ffloorboards.
